<title>UK: Rabobank sets $250 mln four-year bond.</title>
<headline>Rabobank sets $250 mln four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers SBC Warburg and Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RABOBANK NEDERLAND BA</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    12.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.92    PAY DATE    12.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    99.52     SPREAD	+6 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N/LANDS   HOME CTRY  N/LANDS   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
